			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Great Forge fills the central hall of {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}. Molten metal pours from the heights into great basins, and around them the smiths of the city work at anvils that never grow cold. The heat and the light of the forge reach every ward, and its hammering is the sound that dwarves call home. Traders, trainers and messengers crowd its ring, and the gryphons of the city come and go from the terrace nearby. No other place in the city is so busy, and none is so loved.]=],
		},
	},
