• He gave the {link:gnomeregan-exiles}exiles of Gnomeregan{/link} a home in his city.
• He mourns his brother {link:muradin-bronzebeard}Muradin{/link}, lost in Northrend. His brother {link:brann-bronzebeard}Brann{/link} is far away on the League's business.
