			},
			text = [=[When the widow of Sully Balloo wrote to him, Magni did not pretend that her husband's death had been anything but a loss. He said that every {link:dwarves}dwarf{/link} who falls for the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} weighs on his soul. He could not bring Sully back, so he had the Grand Mason carve him a memorial of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link} granite, in the hope that those who come after would remember for whom such soldiers died.]=],
