			},
			text = [=[From the Reliquary of Kings beneath {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link} came a tablet of stone. Magni knew it at once. It was the peace drawn up after the war of the three clans, in the days of his ancestor Madoran, the first Bronzebeard to rule Ironforge. The Bronzebeards had signed it, and the Wildhammers had signed it. The {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} had not.]=],
