			text = [=[Magni wept when he spoke of Moira. He had sent his men to search the {link:burning-steppes}Burning Steppes{/link}, and the only clue they found pointed into the depths of {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link}. He believed her the captive of the Dark Iron emperor, Dagran {link:ruins-of-thaurissan}Thaurissan{/link}, bound by his spells, and he wanted the emperor dead. When the truth came back to him, it was worse than he had feared. Moira carried Thaurissan's child, and she sent word that the heir of {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link} would be a Dark Iron. Magni could only say that even in death, Thaurissan had won.]=],
